---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="market" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-page gap-10 px-5 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-clay">Phoenix</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">The market the name sits on.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-mute">
        The U.S. Census Bureau’s July 1, 2025 estimate puts the Phoenix-Mesa-Chandler metro at
        <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">5,228,938 residents</strong>, up from 5,169,873 a year earlier.
        That is a large, still-growing Sun Belt market where heat, pools, hiking, and tourism keep professional
        waxing on the calendar year-round — including a growing men’s segment.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-mute">
        Source: Census Bureau population estimates, published by FRED as series
        <a class="underline decoration-clay/40 underline-offset-4" href="https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/PHXPOP" rel="noopener noreferrer">PHXPOP</a>.
        Retrieved September 27, 2026. Read the longer note on the
        <a class="underline decoration-clay/40 underline-offset-4" href="/phoenix-waxing-market/">Phoenix waxing market page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="rounded-3xl bg-ink p-7 text-cream">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Demand context</p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-mist">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gold" /> Desert heat makes close shaving irritating for a lot of clients.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gold" /> Outdoor life — hiking, golf, pools — keeps body waxing routine, not seasonal.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gold" /> Tourism and hospitality add visitors who book before events.</li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gold" /> One metro name can cover Phoenix, Scottsdale, Tempe, and Mesa.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
